Package: PathwayLGM
Type: Package
Title: Gaussian Spatial Pathway Inference with INLA
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("PathwayLGM research contributors", role = "aut"),
    person("Research handoff maintainer", role = "cre",
           email = "maintainer@example.org"))
Description: Fits Gaussian spatial pathway models with a shared baseline
    intercept, relative regional effects, conditionally independent regional
    gene effects and replicated gene-specific spatial fields. Computes
    directional pathway probabilities and posterior evidence using compact
    CCD configuration mixtures. Includes checked positive marginal summaries.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: INLA, Matrix, stats, utils, qrng
Suggests: fmesher
Additional_repositories: https://inla.r-inla-download.org/R/stable
Collate:
    'positive_summary.R'
    'pi_engine.R'
    'inla_screen.R'
